{"id":"93fb6c76704357a2","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-2random-generic-downward-dense.md","title":"2随机度以下1泛型度向下稠密","display":"thm-2random-generic-downward-dense — 2随机度以下1泛型度向下稠密","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-2random-generic-downward-dense","aliases":["43-thm-2random-generic-downward-dense"],"display":"thm-2random-generic-downward-dense — 2随机度以下1泛型度向下稠密","depends_on":["[[43-df-nrandom]]","[[43-df-genericity]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_location":"Theorem 11.18.2 (Kurtz)","source_printed_pages":"315–323","source_pdf_pages":"335–343","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-round3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-2random-generic-downward-dense"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-2random-generic-downward-dense</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-2random-generic-downward-dense — 2随机度以下1泛型度向下稠密"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"39322da73a94b6b8\" href=\"?note=39322da73a94b6b8\" title=\"43-df-genericity\">43-df-genericity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 11.18.2 (Kurtz)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"315–323"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"335–343"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{Random}_2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NGeneric}(G,1)\">\\(\\operatorname{NGeneric}(G,1)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_T,\\le_T\">\\(&lt;_T,\\le_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"39322da73a94b6b8\" href=\"?note=39322da73a94b6b8\" title=\"43-df-genericity\">43-df-genericity</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&lt;_TB\">\\(\\varnothing&lt;_TB\\)</span> 表示B具有非零Turing度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_2(X)\\Rightarrow\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl((\\varnothing&lt;_TB\\land B&lt;_TX)\\Rightarrow\\exists G\\in2^\\omega\\;(\\operatorname{NGeneric}(G,1)\\land G\\le_TB)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Random}_2(X)\\Rightarrow\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl((\\varnothing&lt;_TB\\land B&lt;_TX)\\Rightarrow\\exists G\\in2^\\omega\\;(\\operatorname{NGeneric}(G,1)\\land G\\le_TB)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>展开书中“在a以下向下稠密”的定义：每个非零严格下界B都计算一个1泛型点。没有声称G本身随机，也没有把1泛型换成弱1泛型。已核对正式陈述与定义，未独立重证Kurtz的概率下注优先构造。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所供2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 11.18.2 (Kurtz)；印刷页315–323，PDF页335–343。本轮逐项核对来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-nrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-genericity","status":"resolved","id":"39322da73a94b6b8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-genericity]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{Random}_2$、$\\operatorname{NGeneric}(G,1)$、$<_T,\\le_T$ 见 [[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-genericity]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。$\\varnothing<_TB$ 表示B具有非零Turing度。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-genericity","status":"resolved","id":"39322da73a94b6b8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{Random}_2$、$\\operatorname{NGeneric}(G,1)$、$<_T,\\le_T$ 见 [[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-genericity]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。$\\varnothing<_TB$ 表示B具有非零Turing度。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{Random}_2$、$\\